CHAPTER.VERS:
But to you

          {+}
         who fear my name the sun of righteousness will arise with healing in its wings; and you

          {+}
         will go forth, and leap as calves of the stall.

And you

          {+}
         will tread down the wicked; for they will be ashes under the soles of your

          {+}
         feet in the day that I make, says Yahweh of hosts.

Remember

          {+}
         the law of Moses my slave, which I commanded to him in Horeb for all Israel, even statutes and ordinances.

Look, I will send you

          {+}
         Elijah the prophet before the great and awesome day of Yahweh comes.
